# Zhifei's roots on flow-matic (Berkeley, 8xH100, account yichuan_wang), for evolve
# loops that run on a Claude Code subscription. Selected with TRL_PROFILE=andy-flowmatic.
# Plain KEY=VALUE, no expansion. Local disk (/var/tmp is md0, not a network
# filesystem), no linger for the account: the drive runs under setsid.
TRL_BASE=/var/tmp/tw-eval/evolve
TRL_TT=/var/tmp/tw-eval/torchtitan-evolve
